WEBVTT

00:03:25.615 --> 00:03:30.976
Gregory: "I will frown as I pass by,
and let them take it as they list."

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:35.389
Sampson: "Nay, as they dare,
I will bite my thumb at them,

00:03:35.413 --> 00:03:38.883
which is a disgrace
to them, if they bear it."

00:03:38.907 --> 00:03:40.976
Enter Abraham and Balthasar.

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:44.778
Abraham: "Do you bite
your thumb at us, sir?"

00:03:44.802 --> 00:03:47.514
Sampson: "I do bite my thumb, sir."

00:03:47.538 --> 00:03:51.422
Abraham: "Do you bite
your thumb at us, sir?"

00:03:51.446 --> 00:03:55.786
Okay, so how does this development
help us understand mood or character?

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:57.976
Well, let's break it down to the insult.

00:03:58.792 --> 00:04:01.545
Biting your thumb today
may not seem like a big deal,